@KeyInfo - Total Lost : 8540ETH
Attacker : https://etherscan.io/address/0x6C8EC8f14bE7C01672d31CFa5f2CEfeAB2562b50
Attack Contract : https://etherscan.io/address/0x1De399967B206e446B4E9AeEb3Cb0A0991bF11b8
